PAGE 4 — MORE TIME FOR CARE
Panel 1: Dr. Ananya greets Ravi in a consultation room. Dr. Ananya: "Hello, Ravi. Tell me what brings you in."
Panel 2: Ravi describes a routine concern; no diagnosis or medical advice. Ravi: "I've been feeling tired lately."
Panel 3: The doctor listens with attention. Caption: "Technology supports the workflow. The conversation stays human."
Panel 4: Dr. Ananya discusses next steps without giving specific treatment advice. Dr. Ananya: "We'll go through your concerns and decide the right next steps together."

PAGE 5 — CARE DOESN'T END AT THE DOOR
Panel 1: Meera helps Ravi learn about the Welbuk Health patient app. Meera: "Welbuk Health is designed to help patients stay connected with their care."
Panel 2: Ravi sees a friendly conceptual app screen with appointments and health information. Ravi: "So I can keep useful information in one place?"
Panel 3: Meera: "That's the idea. Let's walk through what is available to you."
Panel 4: Ravi leaves, reassured. Caption: "A smoother visit. A more connected experience."

