Panel 1: Ravi travels to another Indian city; simple train-window transition. Caption: "Tomorrow, care may take us beyond our hometown."
Panel 2: A conceptual Welbuk-connected clinic and specialist are shown in a future-vision scene, visibly labeled "WELBUK VISION". Caption: "The vision: trusted connections between clinics, specialists, and patients across locations."
Panel 3: Symbolic family scene with Ravi, partner, and child; a family wellness app illustration. Caption: "One connected ecosystem for care and family wellness."
Panel 4 (large closing panel): Dr. Ananya, Meera and Ravi smile, with three product labels: "Welbuk Practice • Welbuk Care • Welbuk Health". Final caption: "Welbuk — Building a connected healthcare ecosystem."

ART DIRECTION
Full colour, approachable Indian slice-of-life manga, expressive faces, precise hands, restrained blue and teal accents, warm natural clinic, consistent character appearances. Western left-to-right reading order. Vary panel sizes. Make panel art WITHOUT speech bubbles or text; compose English dialogue separately. Avoid real patient data, unsupported medical claims, and portraying future vision as launched capability.
